        "name": "EITC (Earned Income Tax Credit) / Tax Benefits",
        "description": "Works to change how Americans with low or no incomes access tax credits and flexible cash owed to them, aiming to close the $40 billion tax benefits gap and simplify tax filing (e.g., GetCTC, GetYourRefund)."
